  "description": "UPHILL. DOWNHILL. WHY NOT BOTH? Few bikes embody limitless trail adventures quite like the KAPOHO. For years, it has ranked among the most popular full-suspension e-MTBs, impressing riders with a level of versatility that is second to none. Whether tackling demanding climbs, technical descents, or all-day rides, the KAPOHO feels at home everywhere. With 160 mm of travel, it combines outstanding trail performance with exceptional long-distance comfort, making it the perfect all-rounder for riders who refuse to be defined by a single riding style. The proven Straight-Line-Link (SLL) suspension concept delivers a sensitive response, maximum control, and a confidence-inspiring ride feel, even on the most challenging trails. To achieve its exceptional performance, the KAPOHO relies on KTM’s proven DiMMiX concept. The 29-inch front wheel provides stability, precision, and confidence at speed, while the 27.5-inch PLUS rear wheel delivers maximum traction and efficient power transfer. Together, they create a setup that truly excels in demanding terrain. Power comes from the new Bosch Performance Line CX-R drive unit. Delivering up to 120 Nm of torque, 750 watts of peak power, and a s upport factor of up to 600%, it provides all the assistance needed for steep climbs, rapid acceleration, and demanding trail sections. At the same time, the 800 Wh PowerTube battery offers the endurance to keep going when the ride turns into an all-day adventure. For maximum everyday convenience, KTM continues to rely on its proven Power Tube Top Loader (PTTL) concept. The battery can be removed upwards from the downtube quickly, safely, and effortlessly.",
